More general stuff
------------------

Check the .ref files that modify qx against boards, lines
(Output #lines from C++ as well?)

Workflow
========
In GitHub/Build/src:
./reader -I ../../../bboD -Q 9=4=0=0 -v 63 > raw.txt
Edit out the bottom lines
Copy to GitHub/Valet/scripts/Euro-and-World/bbo

perl cook.pl raw.txt > t
Edit out the bottom lines

perl digest t > d

Things that get modified to fix errors:
- EntryT.pm, list of scoring adjustments (especially pairs tournaments)
- Title/Study.pm, regex substitution of ranges of BBONO numbers
- The .ref files

Can look at weekdays:
foreach f (..$/Tournaments/*pm)
  perl weekday.pl $f > ../Tournaments/DATED/`basename $f`
end

perl checkT.pl
checks internal consistency of Tournament and Meet.

perl checkB.pl t
checks BBO entry field values vs. Tournament and Meet.
